b706b327-f0cf-4124-aaba-f498e83a75d2/12164-2
01:42:50.864 --> 01:42:54.960
versus many core where we have thousands
of simpler cores.

b706b327-f0cf-4124-aaba-f498e83a75d2/12164-3
